<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Admin Danger Zone is one of the server administration windows. Open it from File > Admin; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_warning}>{dgettext("help_features", "What a wipe removes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The preview lists what /admin nuke would delete. Admin roles, audit logs, server bans and server settings survive it, with registration reopened so an admin nick can be recreated; everything else does not. This cannot be undone."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "The confirmation")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The button stays disabled until you type the server's current name. The server checks the same thing when the form is submitted, so a stale button is never what authorizes a wipe — if the server was renamed after the preview loaded, the submission is refused."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_features", "admin console")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-admin-nuke">{dgettext("help_features", "/admin nuke")}</.help_link>
</p>
